# Paste into Vercel -> your project -> Settings -> Environment Variables (Production and Preview). Git-ignored.
# Live updates connect straight to the API host (Vercel cannot proxy websockets). The app works without this; it just won't update live.
VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://b2b-project-v91w.onrender.com

# Do NOT set VITE_API_BASE_URL: in production the app calls same-origin /api, which frontend/vercel.json proxies to Render.
# Do NOT put secrets in VITE_* variables: they are bundled into the public JavaScript.
